idth=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mercenary%20Sword\"><img alt=\"Mercenary Sword\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mercenary_Sword_0a8719.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Spellbook%20of%20Mind%20Control\"><img alt=\"Spellbook of Mind Control\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spellbook_of_Mind_Control_15eca0.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Swamplair Armor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Swamplair_Armor_18bf2a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.40<br/>December 10, 2008<br/>Winter Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>In this part of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Magician%20Quarter\">Magician Quarter</a> you can hunt ~15 <a href=\"#/wiki/Novice%20of%20the%20Cult\">Novices of the Cult</a> outside a building. To enter the building you have to go through a <a href=\"#/wiki/Gate%20of%20Expertise\">Gate of Expertise</a> and be level 30. Inside the building you can hunt <a href=\"#/wiki/Novice%20of%20the%20Cult\">Novice of the Cult</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Acolyte%20of%20the%20Cult\">Acolyte of the Cult</a> on the ground floor and upstairs. If you go downstairs you will find <a href=\"#/wiki/Acolyte%20of%20the%20Cult\">Acolyte of the Cult</a> and another <a href=\"#/wiki/Gate%20of%20Expertise\">Gate of Expertise</a> for level 40. Going further down until level -4 you will meet stronger Cults and a single <a href=\"#/wiki/Serpent%20Spawn\">Serpent Spawn</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Research Centre Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Novice%20of%20the%20Cult\"><img alt=\"Novice of the Cult\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Novice_of_the_Cult_05436f.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Novice%20of%20the%20Cult\">Novice of the Cult</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">100</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">285</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">270</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-40× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"